WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.464 --> 00:00:02.625
Wow! Who are you?

2
00:00:02.645 --> 00:00:04.026
I'm a chameleon.

3
00:00:04.066 --> 00:00:06.327
We are colorful lizards.

4
00:00:06.547 --> 00:00:19.274
Where do you We mostly live in Africa.

5
00:00:31.688 --> 00:00:33.669
Some chameleons live in the desert.

6
00:00:35.270 --> 00:00:37.731
But most live in African rain forests.

7
00:00:43.634 --> 00:00:44.914
I like your colors!

8
00:00:46.955 --> 00:00:48.896
We can change our colors to communicate.

9
00:00:50.397 --> 00:00:53.038
Changing colors helps us stay hot or cool.

10
00:00:54.939 --> 00:00:57.500
Our green skin helps us hide in trees.

11
00:01:00.756 --> 00:01:02.457
You're a good climber.

12
00:01:05.159 --> 00:01:07.160
Our toes help us grip branches.

13
00:01:09.241 --> 00:01:10.362
Our tails help too.

14
00:01:12.103 --> 00:01:13.724
We can wrap them around things.

15
00:01:18.566 --> 00:01:20.127
What do chameleons eat?

16
00:01:21.848 --> 00:01:24.170
We eat insects like crickets and grasshoppers.

17
00:01:26.011 --> 00:01:28.132
Big chameleons eat other lizards and birds.

18
00:01:32.060 --> 00:01:34.462
You have a long, sticky tongue!

19
00:01:36.323 --> 00:01:38.005
We can shoot our tongues out fast.

20
00:01:38.265 --> 00:01:44.730
See? We use our tongues to catch insects.

21
00:01:46.792 --> 00:01:48.993
Do your eyes help you find food?

22
00:01:50.855 --> 00:01:52.856
Yes. Our eyes work very well.

23
00:01:55.678 --> 00:01:57.580
Each eye can move in a different direction.

24
00:02:00.116 --> 00:02:01.800
So we can see two things at once.

25
00:02:05.528 --> 00:02:06.129
There's a cricket.

26
00:02:06.530 --> 00:02:10.478
Yum! Good-bye, Chameleon!
